// pointer each code point encodes as (the spec's "index pointer", or its
// Big5 variant); SHIFT_JIS_OVERRIDES holds the code points the Shift_JIS
// variant gives another pointer. Regenerated, not hand-maintained:
// veripublica/styloria/gen/encodings.py.

